{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Reel it! Fishing",
    "steam_appid": 3650090,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's go fishing on the Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast your rod at different locations, each with its own unique scenery and fish to catch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach for the ultimate high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Score Attack]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch lots of fish and earn points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for the biggest fish to earn the biggest rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye out for rare creatures\u2014there's more than just fish in this river!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Ranking]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with players from around the world for the highest score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show off your skills by increasing your high score and rank!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Battle]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against CPUs in single-player mode, or test your skills against friends in multiplayer battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Records]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each fish that you catch in Score Attack or Battle Mode will be recorded in your encyclopedia!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work hard to reel in every fish and fill out every page!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's go fishing on the Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast your rod at different locations, each with its own unique scenery and fish to catch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach for the ultimate high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Score Attack]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch lots of fish and earn points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for the biggest fish to earn the biggest rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye out for rare creatures\u2014there's more than just fish in this river!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Ranking]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with players from around the world for the highest score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show off your skills by increasing your high score and rank!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Battle]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against CPUs in single-player mode, or test your skills against friends in multiplayer battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Records]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each fish that you catch in Score Attack or Battle Mode will be recorded in your encyclopedia!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work hard to reel in every fish and fill out every page!</p>",
